 "independence": "Ensembl Variation imports rsID placements from dbSNP, so Ensembl GRCh37 Variation, dbSNP and the VEP bundle are one identity lineage. The assembly-map projection aligns assemblies and the flank comparison reads assembly sequence; neither reads a variant record, so each is independent of the identity route in method, though all are served by Ensembl. Every position and every strand rests on two of these routes, except rs2270662's strand, which rests on the flank comparison alone.",
